# A sealed room is a closed system. Nothing in it may change totals.
#
# This is the cheapest possible regression on the solver: if a future edit breaks conservation,
# it breaks here first, and it says so in grams rather than in a picture.
new sealed 20 14
run 100
expect vented == 0
expect substeps <= 2

# Mass and energy are asserted against their own starting values by FluidlabSimTest; what this
# script adds is the long run — 100 ticks rather than 40 — where a slow leak would show.
state
